{
  "text": "```systemverilog\nmodule rstgen (\n    input  logic clk_i,\n    input  logic rst_ni,\n    input  logic test_mode_i,\n    output logic rst_no,\n    output logic init_no\n);\n\n    // Synchronization chain for reset release\n    logic sync_rst_n [2:0];\n\n    always_ff @(posedge clk_i) begin\n        sync_rst_n[0] <= rst_ni;\n        sync_rst_n[1] <= sync_rst_n[0];\n        sync_rst_n[2] <= sync_rst_n[1];\n    end\n\n    // Synchronized reset output\n    assign rst_no = test_mode_i ? rst_ni : sync_rst_n[2];\n\n    // Initialization qualifier: high for a few cycles after reset release\n    // Use a counter that counts up after reset release\n    logic [3:0] init_cnt;\n    logic init_done;\n\n    always_ff @(posedge clk_i) begin\n        if (!rst_no) begin\n            init_cnt  <= 4'd0;\n            init_done <= 1'b0;\n        end else begin\n            if (!init_done) begin\n                if (init_cnt == 4'd3) begin\n                    init_done <= 1'b1;\n                end else begin\n                    init_cnt <= init_cnt + 4'd1;\n                end\n            end\n        end\n    end\n\n    assign init_no = init_done;\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
